WEBVTT

00:09:00.077 --> 00:09:03.831
But I take solace in knowing
that their stories are being shared

00:09:03.872 --> 00:09:05.583
and that they are being remembered,

00:09:05.583 --> 00:09:07.710
because my grandfather was right.

00:09:08.127 --> 00:09:11.839
Stories keep people alive and real to us.

00:09:13.674 --> 00:09:15.009
Thank you.

00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:20.681
(Applause)